      "text": "Salesforce Pub/Sub case alerting requires separate checks for authentication metadata, integration-user API access, CDC object permissions, supported org editions, and event delivery capacity. Delivery usage grows across API subscribers and shares a pool with high-volume platform events. Default delivery allocations differ from add-on monthly entitlements. Primary Salesforce limits also need to be distinguished from connector batching settings. A practitioner incident demonstrates how a long-lived browser subscriber can exhaust a shared allocation while internal processing continues.",
